############################################################
# LONG-READ 16S MICROBIOME STORAGE STUDY
# Genus-level Bray-Curtis beta-diversity
#
# Study design:
# 12 children, each with 3 matched aliquots:
#   Baseline = unstored
#   Test     = -20 C for 6 months
#   GoldStd  = -80 C for 6 months
#
# Main analyses:
# 1. Overall matched PERMANOVA (3 conditions)
# 2. Matched PERMANOVA (-20 C vs -80 C)
# 3. Secondary baseline comparisons
# 4. NMDS visualization
# 5. Dispersion diagnostics
############################################################


